0237bc6e","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i11.tinypic.com\/2ir9ehf.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n This is mine, except the setting is white gold instead of platinum, and the stone is a 1.25 ct radiant cut instead of the princess cut. I really don&#039;t know what band would go with it, since it seems most bands would cover up the scrollwork on the side, and I don&#039;t want to do that!\n \n Of course, I should probably wait until I actually have the ring on my finger before I worry about the band, huh? LOL! I&#039;m hoping it&#039;s this weekend.\n \n Oh, and I totally picked this out myself. I feel kinda bad about that, but not as bad as I knew I would feel if he picked something I didn&#039;t like!","Attachments":[],"Id":5429,"PostDate":1162437205,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a href='http:\/\/i11.tinypic.com\/2ir9ehf.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i11.tinypic.com\/2ir9ehf.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> This is mine, except the setting is white gold instead of platinum, and the stone is a 1.25 ct radiant cut instead of the princess cut. I really don't know what band would go with it, since it seems most bands would cover up the scrollwork on the side, and I don't want to do that!<br \/> <br \/> Of course, I should probably wait until I actually have the ring on my finger before I worry about the band, huh? LOL! I'm hoping it's this weekend.<br \/> <br \/> Oh, and I totally picked this out myself. I feel kinda bad about that, but not as bad as I knew I would feel if he picked something I didn't like!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caroljohnston_2000@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1161815371,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206870.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"carolj","Id":206870,"Name":"carolj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46ca1b7fa539584798dab72ac270de29","RawContent":"Jackie and Tasha - I also loooooove the cushion cut! And Sarah - I love all the little detailing in your ring. I am totally a sucker for anything that looks romantic\/antique I guess.\n \n And I finally took a good pic of my e-ring and band together. I can&#039;t wait to finally wear them both!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/static.flickr.com\/101\/290082520_9994c19570_m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":6163,"PostDate":1162842964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jackie and Tasha - I also loooooove the cushion cut! And Sarah - I love all the little detailing in your ring. I am totally a sucker for anything that looks romantic\/antique I guess.<br \/> <br \/> And I finally took a good pic of my e-ring and band together. I can't wait to finally wear them both!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/static.flickr.com\/101\/290082520_9994c19570_m.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/static.flickr.com\/101\/290082520_9994c19570_m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janet.daly@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.33.145.106","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1138253340,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206713.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":288,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Janet","Id":206713,"Name":"Janet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ee216e53a048e3d8d868bcc136a781b","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/MBP_6975.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Here is a picture of mine from when we did our pictures in Cabo with Manuel Burgoin. It is a oval center stone with a pear on each side. I love it!!! I don&#039;t think we will be able to have a band that will work with it since the shape is different than normal - I have had people tell me they can make something but I am afraid it would take away from the stones and overall look of the ring. Maybe I can convince FI to get me a ring for my other hand - fat chance!!!\n \n On a side note - I found his ring and COSTCO and paid $1800 for it. It is platnum and has 8 or 9 rund stones in it - very pretty but not something I would ever picture him liking! He really showed no interest in shopping for a ring so since we were there I had him try one on - I got it with the thought that he might become more interested in shopping for a ring if he saw I was going to buy one and he might get stuck with it (I know COSTCO will take anything back so I wasn&#039;t really concerned.) Well that was last Tuesday and he has yet to take the ring off! I told him that he wasn&#039;t suppost to wear the ring until we get married and he said that since I get to wear my ring he should get to wear his too! Kinda cute but not at all what I expected from him! I guess this is the ring he is going to end up with afterall!","Attachments":[],"Id":8068,"PostDate":1163956926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a href='http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/MBP_6975.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/MBP_6975.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> Here is a picture of mine from when we did our pictures in Cabo with Manuel Burgoin. It is a oval center stone with a pear on each side. I love it!!! I don't think we will be able to have a band that will work with it since the shape is different than normal - I have had people tell me they can make something but I am afraid it would take away from the stones and overall look of the ring. Maybe I can convince FI to get me a ring for my other hand - fat chance!!!<br \/> <br \/> On a side note - I found his ring and COSTCO and paid $1800 for it. It is platnum and has 8 or 9 rund stones in it - very pretty but not something I would ever picture him liking! He really showed no interest in shopping for a ring so since we were there I had him try one on - I got it with the thought that he might become more interested in shopping for a ring if he saw I was going to buy one and he might get stuck with it (I know COSTCO will take anything back so I wasn't really concerned.) Well that was last Tuesday and he has yet to take the ring off! I told him that he wasn't suppost to wear the ring until we get married and he said that since I get to wear my ring he should get to wear his too! Kinda cute but not at all what I expected from him! I guess this is the ring he is going to end up with afterall!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Sarah's little girl-Isabella Nicole-10\/31\/08<\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j286\/caboweddingforum\/isabella034.jpg\">http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j2...sabella034.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sarahpropertymanager@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.244.56.118","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1143847500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206730.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SASSYGIRL","Id":206730,"Name":"SASSYGIRL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"156ecf9e1bd05fa5f4e0c04a13d7fa99","RawContent":"Here&#039;s mine! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.pricescope.com\/idealbb\/files\/anillo02.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":8075,"PostDate":1163965255,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's mine! <a href='http:\/\/www.pricescope.com\/idealbb\/files\/anillo02.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.pricescope.com\/idealbb\/files\/anillo02.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>- Anny.<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i75.photobucket.com\/albums\/i284\/anacristina_ge\/Biz\/bdwsiggy.jpg\">http:\/\/i75.photobucket.com\/albums\/i2...z\/bdwsiggy.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.passportinvitations.com\">www.passportinvitations.com<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.anaderoux.com\">My webpage<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/anaderoux.blogspot.com\">My blog<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt8b0dc.aspx\">http:\/\/global.thebump.com\/tickers\/tt8b0dc.aspx<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"anacristina_ge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1163924520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/d\/d1\/d1295c45_user-674-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anaderoux","Id":206916,"Name":"anaderoux","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"faf97d3ad27ad2941cf50f7846aa3148","RawContent":"Hey, I finally get to post a *real* picture of my ring here! Scott officially proposed Saturday night.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i7.tinypic.com\/4hwf6a8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i10.tinypic.com\/48rq8n6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I&#039;m like a little girl - I can&#039;t help but look at it in every possible light to see just how sparkly it is!\n \n P.S. Sorry for the huge pics! I don&#039;t know how to resize them to make them smaller.","Attachments":[],"Id":8189,"PostDate":1164032588,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey, I finally get to post a *real* picture of my ring here! Scott officially proposed Saturday night.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i7.tinypic.com\/4hwf6a8.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i7.tinypic.com\/4hwf6a8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i10.tinypic.com\/48rq8n6.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i10.tinypic.com\/48rq8n6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> I'm like a little girl - I can't help but look at it in every possible light to see just how sparkly it is!<br \/> <br \/> P.S. Sorry for the huge pics! I don't know how to resize them to make them smaller.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caroljohnston_2000@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1161815371,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206870.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"carolj","Id":206870,"Name":"carolj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e6ae5e0bf1a2c50a687d988e2cefa2c","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=popup&amp;amp;ed=vB_Editor_001\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;I just realized I&#039;ve never posted my ring! Here it is...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/284456a57eebab86.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":9009,"PostDate":1164601008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=popup&ed=vB_Editor_001' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=popup&ed=vB_Editor_001\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>I just realized I've never posted my ring! Here it is...<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=253' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/284456a57eebab86.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/284456a57eebab86.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katesig@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.247.242.206","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154919300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206773.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":85,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"-Kate-","Id":206773,"Name":"-Kate-","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee5a095c2b7c1ee39ef9acb53773fb30","RawContent":"alrighty, here you go. We did a little mini ering\/wedding band photo shoot tonight...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v396\/nabumbah\/IMGP0570.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v396\/nabumbah\/IMGP0568.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":9959,"PostDate":1165037585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                alrighty, here you go. We did a little mini ering\/wedding band photo shoot tonight...<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v396\/nabumbah\/IMGP0570.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v396\/nabumbah\/IMGP0570.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v396\/nabumbah\/IMGP0568.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v396\/nabumbah\/IMGP0568.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/jimkennedyphotography.com\/movienatasha\/\">3.24.07 cabo surf<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/nabumbah.livejournal.com\/\">year two.<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/20th.teamintraining.org\/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=20th%2BAdwords\">i ran 26.2 - I helped save lives.<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v396\/nabumbah\/family157-1.jpg\">http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v3...amily157-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nabumbah@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1147448760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206733.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":83,"PhotoHeight":99,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NABUMBAH","Id":206733,"Name":"NABUMBAH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"960f01b359d0e4bcfe4b2b72991afd67","RawContent":"Hanssel finally &amp;quot;officially&amp;quot; proposed last night! Now I can show off my ring.&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/584457c50bd9bb05.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":11102,"PostDate":1165778648,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hanssel finally \"officially\" proposed last night! Now I can show off my ring.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/vbimghost.php?do=displayimg&imgid=388' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/584457c50bd9bb05.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/584457c50bd9bb05.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Photo by <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog'>www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/amyhs-planning-galore-24132\/index10.html'>Planning Pics!<\/a> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/amyhs-puerto-vallarta-wedding-more-review-works-25255\/index4.html'>PV and Wedding Review<\/a><strong class='bbc'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures?authkey=w0DgS3ao1sI#'>Pro Pics (1)<\/a>; <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures2?authkey=vbG3xUMVk1s#'>Pro Pics (2)<\/a><\/strong> <strong class='bbc'>By Nataly Lemus Photography and Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/strong> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/natalylemusphoto.blogspot.com\/2008\/07\/amy-hanssel-married.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Nataly Lemus Photogaphy<\/a><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.arpiaphotoblog.com\/2008\/07\/puerto-vallarta-destination-wedding_3102.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/a>","Email":"amyhmartin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.119.192.139","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1162157640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206875.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyh","Id":206875,"Name":"amyh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85b5239be896afe6f07013de6077b98f","RawContent":"&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Century Gothic\"&gt;All these gorgeous rings - agh...&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Century Gothic\"&gt;My ring is a cushion cut in a platinum diamond wire setting. The ring&#039;s shank is single not double wire with a Single Row of Pave Diamonds unlike in the attached picture. When i saw it, I knew I had to have it :)\n \n &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/loretuke1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/loretuke2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;3800&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;my ring.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:75.5,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":11223,"PostDate":1165871816,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font face=\"Century Gothic\">All these gorgeous rings - agh...<\/font><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font face=\"Century Gothic\">My ring is a cushion cut in a platinum diamond wire setting. The ring's shank is single not double wire with a Single Row of Pave Diamonds unlike in the attached picture. When i saw it, I knew I had to have it <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> <\/font><\/font><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/loretuke1.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/loretuke1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a> <a href='http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/loretuke2.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/loretuke2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"3800\",\"name\":\"my ring.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":75.5,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Loreta<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.studiocontempo.com\/trashthedress\/\">http:\/\/www.studiocontempo.com\/trashthedress\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ourwedding.studiocontempo.com\">http:\/\/ourwedding.studiocontempo.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/studiocontempo.blogspot.com\">http:\/\/studiocontempo.blogspot.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lray@spt.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1163542740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206901.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"loretuke","Id":206901,"Name":"loretuke","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d70db30a0ee74defdbd642236647d18","RawContent":"Natasha - I (this Natasha) did the same thing. I either wear my engagement ring:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.tiffany.com\/shared\/images\/diamond\/photo\/engagement_fancy_pearsides.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n or my wedding band (this is actually a really pretty ring but this image is awful!)\n \n &lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/111457e2280cc2f4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n \n But I don&#039;t ever wear them together. Also, my Ering is still way too big even though I had it sized once. I just don&#039;t have time to deal with it, though!","Attachments":[],"Id":11299,"PostDate":1165898119,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Natasha - I (this Natasha) did the same thing. I either wear my engagement ring:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/javascript%3cb%3e%3c\/b%3E:enlargedView('engagement_fancy_pearsides','',2);' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><a href=\"http:\/\/www.tiffany.com\/shared\/images\/diamond\/photo\/engagement_fancy_pearsides.jpg\" rel=\"lytebox[posts]\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.tiffany.com\/shared\/images\/diamond\/photo\/engagement_fancy_pearsides.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/a><br \/> <br \/> or my wedding band (this is actually a really pretty ring but this image is awful!)<br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/111457e2280cc2f4.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/111457e2280cc2f4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> But I don't ever wear them together. Also, my Ering is still way too big even though I had it sized once. I just don't have time to deal with it, though!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Shawn and NatashaHappily MarriedNovember 11, 2006<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"xtra858sd@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1143521820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206727.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NATASHA","Id":206727,"Name":"NATASHA","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"254","Title":"show us your rings!","LastPostDate":1478682189},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2114,"TotalPages":212,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":2110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
