\"]\nI will suggest you to ask your Event Management Company to deal with this.\nGenerally wedding planner also provides designer to designs dresses under budgets and they also knows which dress will suites best as per destination.\n[img]https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/40\/86\/35\/408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.indianfashionlife.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-Bride-in-red-Color.jpg[\/img][\/quote]I love these dresses!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914614,"PostDate":1467432370,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RitvikSehgal, on 10 May 2016 - 01:51 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I will suggest you to ask your <a href='#' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Event Management Company<\/a> to deal with this.<\/p>\n<p>Generally wedding planner also provides designer to designs dresses under budgets and they also knows which dress will suites best as per destination.<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/40\/86\/35\/408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg\" alt=\"408635f37c563f60965755d6fb3280b8.jpg\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.indianfashionlife.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-Bride-in-red-Color.jpg\" alt=\"Designer-Engagement-Dresses-For-Indian-B\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I love these dresses!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\">Event planner and curator at <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.poptop.uk.com'>http:\/\/www.poptop.uk.com<\/a>\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"><strong>Poptop <\/strong>event marketplace <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/span>","Email":"svitlanapoptop@gmail.com","IpAddress":"95.158.49.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1467098318,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SvitlanaG","Id":287249,"Name":"SvitlanaG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.61.195.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7497c6da4778498f86f147cd1b5bec64","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;\u5b8b\u4f53&#039;;\"&gt;After reading all your shopping experience from dressilyme, I would like to share mine. :D&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;\u5b8b\u4f53&#039;;font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;\u5b8b\u4f53&#039;;\"&gt;I just bought a sequins ruffles mother of the bride dress bought for my mum &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;\u5b8b\u4f53&#039;;font-size:16px;\"&gt;from&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;\u5b8b\u4f53&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/dressilyme.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/dressilyme.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;\u5b8b\u4f53&#039;;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;and it was really shinning. When she saw it, she thought the dress was too shinning and sexy for her age, but when she put it on she said it&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;\u2019&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;\u5b8b\u4f53&#039;;\"&gt;s perfect on her. She loves it very much, and I was so happy. The mother of the bride dress fit my mum very well, both the style and the color. The 30D chiffon material was in high quality, the price was really not high for such a good dress. The dress came in branded zipper bag of dressilyme.com which is so nice. All in all, this is a perfect shop; I&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;\u2019&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;\u5b8b\u4f53&#039;;\"&gt;ll come here next time. :)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;\u5b8b\u4f53&#039;;font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915632,"PostDate":1473828305,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:'\u5b8b\u4f53';\">After reading all your shopping experience from dressilyme, I would like to share mine. <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'\u5b8b\u4f53';font-size:12pt;\">\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:'\u5b8b\u4f53';\">I just bought a sequins ruffles mother of the bride dress bought for my mum <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'\u5b8b\u4f53';font-size:16px;\">from\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:'\u5b8b\u4f53';\"><a href='http:\/\/dressilyme.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/dressilyme.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:'\u5b8b\u4f53';\">\u00a0and it was really shinning. When she saw it, she thought the dress was too shinning and sexy for her age, but when she put it on she said it<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\">\u2019<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:'\u5b8b\u4f53';\">s perfect on her. She loves it very much, and I was so happy. The mother of the bride dress fit my mum very well, both the style and the color. The 30D chiffon material was in high quality, the price was really not high for such a good dress. The dress came in branded zipper bag of dressilyme.com which is so nice. All in all, this is a perfect shop; I<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\">\u2019<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:'\u5b8b\u4f53';\">ll come here next time. <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'\u5b8b\u4f53';font-size:12pt;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wencyhehe@gmail.com","IpAddress":"45.32.225.49","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1473743860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kelly98","Id":287727,"Name":"Kelly98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.126.20.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c77a474a721e3a10708773c33f4e5887","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hi, I do not buy dress from dressilyme, but I bought a prom dress from 1st-dress.com, the dress is amaizing! You can try it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":36502,"Name":"9a457d951d2a51bb90bf17cc728a4fcd.png","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2016\/post-287926-0-43677200-1477020903.png","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2016\/post-287926-0-43677200-1477020903_thumb.png","Width":899,"Height":1200}],"Id":1916533,"PostDate":1477006567,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hi, I do not buy dress from dressilyme, but I bought a prom dress from 1st-dress.com, the dress is amaizing! You can try it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samantha2008abc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.126.20.228","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1477003699,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"samantha2008","Id":287926,"Name":"samantha2008","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"69230","Title":"Dresses from Dressilyme","LastPostDate":1477006567},"Pages":{"TotalItems":43,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
